  "description": "My family went completely bankrupt.    \n\nThe parents I trusted abandoned me and fled in the middle of the night. And the person who saved me when I was left all alone was none other than Damian, my childhood friend.\n\n\"Do you have somewhere to stay? A way to earn money?\"  \n\n\"Not right now, but I can work as a maid for a noble family! They provide food and lodging!\"  \n\n\"Then why don't you come work for me?\"\n\nAnd just like that, I became Damian's personal maid. I thought I owed him a debt of gratitude I could never repay.   \nBut then...\n\n\"What are you doing, Hazel? You're supposed to lie across my lap.\"\n\nSomehow, it seemed like a win-win situation?\n\n\"What a naughty maid. To think you actually enjoy being punished.\"  \n\n\"I'm sorry... Ahh... I'm so sorry...\"\n\nMy heart was pounding, and my breathing grew ragged. My mind went completely blank, leaving me unable to think about anything. All I wanted was for Damian to spank me just a little more...   \nI think I might be a pervert!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587014919)",
